  "body": "Six probe dialect tests plus `arc_planes`, `inverted_equivalence`, `inverted_post` and `vertical_arc_entry` live in `app` only because they generate a toolpath through app before posting it. Record those toolpaths as `.cl` files and have the tests read them, in `crates/post/tests`.\n\nSafety: a recorded input must be regenerated when its generator changes - say how that is checked (a test in the generating crate that compares against the recorded file).\n\nDone means: the 10 tests run outside app from recorded `.cl` input; no new dependency between crates; each recorded file has a generator-side test that fails when it goes stale.\n\nLists, counts and evidence: the research comment on #919 (https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/919#issuecomment-6808141599).\n\nPart of #919.\n",
